<div class="page">
  <div class="column-container">
    <div class="column">
      <h2>Public Programs</h2>
      <p>A variety of symposia, book signings, and presentations are featured yearly, including two endowed lectureships. The <span data-field="name_1">{{ name_1 }}</span> Lecturer is a nationally known expert in his or her field.</p>
      <p>
        <span data-field="name_2">{{ name_2 }}</span> Research Fellowship supports use of AHC’s collections by a recognized scholar in the history of economic geology or a related field.
      </p>
      <h2>Publications</h2>
      <p>The AHC publishes a newsletter twice each year, with information on new collections and traveling exhibits, lectures and other events, as well as general information the evolution of the center and the larger world of historical repositories. In addition, the AHC publishes a colorful annual report each summer.</p>
      <img src="placeholder_image_3.jpg" alt="Document Image 3" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin-top: 20px;">
